<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">- pogoro Bible version 13/9/05</book>
  <para style="h">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Yona</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yona</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">YONA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Vilifana ndiri nakaka na shitabu vimonga vya wambuyi wa Mlungu, chitabu sha Yona ndo lutakuziwu. Takuzia habari za nabii yumbele pakati A.K. Pakati 2 Wafalme 14:25. Yona kangugezia kumtula lushem lwa Mlungu na mwembeli kangulihola hashi kavuatiti lushem alu wa gugendi kuhubiri cha upatiti kumota handagaa ngalikulolela. Wanineri waluiti gwe Yona vikuhelepela ndiri. Fundisia kulu: Mlungu mweni kanonguzia, watakuzia gwakuwi ndala lya gwenga gudayila. Pili: Wasinda kumtulila Mlumgu mbaka lya gwahera maya gwakui wantu gwakuwi. Pya m'bwalomu (sena)</para>
  <para style="io">Yona kagelia kumtila Mlungu 1:1-17</para>
  <para style="io">Mfanu wa Yona 2:1-10</para>
  <para style="io">Yona alalika mwakupokanyisana na Ninevi 3:1-10</para>
  <para style="io">Yona kakalala kwa mana Mlungu kana lusungu 4:1-11</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s">Yona kamjimira ndiri Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />Lishaka limu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Yona mwana gwa Amitayi, <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" />“Mona ukondora wa wantu mlushi lukulu lwa Ninawi. Su gugendi gwakawaberiziyi wantu toziya ya ukondora wawu unfikira neni.” <verse eid="JON 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" />Kumbiti Yona kamshapiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi kaliholiti kugenda Tarishishi. Kaseleriti kugenda lushi lwa Yopa, kawoniti uwatu mkulu yagugenda Tarishishi. Kulii Yona kalipiti mpiya kugenda mwanja kwa uwatu mkulu yauweriti wankugenda lushi lwa Tarishishii, su kashapiri kutenda shilii shakagambirituwi na Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="JON 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kajegiti liyega mubahali, mankapala ga mashi ganjiti kuguvumisiya uwatu mkulu gulii sambira gupantiki. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" />Washima uwatu woseri waweriti na lyoga nentu na kila yumu kanjiti kumluwa kwa milungu yakuwi iwalopoli. Shakapanu womberi wasiliti visanka mubahali su uwatu gupunguli utopa wakuwi nagulidiba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 1:5">Kumbiti Yona kagenditi pahala pa kugonja, su yomberi kagonjiti mpota. <verse eid="JON 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Mkulu gwa yawashima uwatu kaseleleriti kugenda kwakagonjiti mpota Yona. Yomberi kumkosiya, “Gwenga guweza hashi kugonja mpota? Gwimuki na gumluwi mlungu gwaku! Pamonga mekawezi kutuwonera lusungu natwagamira.”<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Shakapanu woseri walitakuziyiti weni, “Guleki tugalambuziyi simbi tuvimani gaa yakatenditi aga gatupati.” Womberi wazigalambuziyiti simbi na zimguwiriti Yona. <verse eid="JON 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Su womberi wamkosiyiti Yona, “Shondi shondi gutugambiri! Iwera hashi ntabiku ayi itupata? Gwenga gutenda lihengu gaa? Gwega gulawa koshi? Gwenga gulawa isi gaa? Likabila lyaku gaa?”<verse eid="JON 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" />Yona kawawankura, “Neni Mwebraniya na numguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa kumpindi, ulii yakanyawiti bahali pamuhera na isi.” <verse eid="JON 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />Shitwatira ashi shiwatenditi womberi waweri na lyoga nentu, su wamkosiyiti yomberi, “Gwenga gutenda shishi?” Womberi wavimaniti kuwera Yona kaweriti kankumshapira Mtuwa Mlungu toziya Yomberi kawagambiriti kala. <verse eid="JON 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />Shaka ashi liyega liweriti likulu na mankapala ga mashi gendereyiti kuwera makulu mubahali. Su womberi wamkosiyiti Yona, “Twenga tutendi hashi bahali iweri jii?”<verse eid="JON 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" />Yona kawankuliti, “Muntoli neni munasili mubahali, su bahali haiweri jii. Nuvimana kuwera ntabiku ayi ilawira toziya ntenda ndiri shilii shakang'ambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JON 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />Kumbiti womberi wendereyiti kushima uwatu ulii wasoki muisi. Kumbiti womberi wasinditi toziya liyega lyendereyiti kuvuma ng'anji mubahali. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" />Shakapanu womberi wamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu, kila yumu gwawu kaluwiti, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, shondi shondi nagutwagamiziya toziya ya kumlaga muntu ayu. Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gwenga gutenda shilii shagufira kushitenda. Twenga tuvimana ndiri handa muntu ayu katenda vidoda. Handa yomberi katenda ndiri vidoda, nagututenda twenga tuweri na vidodda kwa kutenda muntu ayu kahowi!” <verse eid="JON 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" />Shakapanu womberi wamtoliti Yona na kumwasa mumabahali, bahali iweriti jii. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Shitwatira ashi pashilawiriti, shiwatenditi washima uwatu waweri na lyoga likulu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, su womberi wamlaviliriti tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu na waturiti shirapu kwakuwi. <verse eid="JON 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamjegiti somba mkulu kammili Yona, Yona kalikaliti mumtima mwa somba ulii kwa mashaka matatu.<verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="s">Maluwa ga Yona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Yona pakaweriti mumtima mwa somba, su kamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu ulii yakamguwiriti, <verse eid="JON 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />pakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">“Mtuwa Mlungu, paweriti muntabiku nkulu panu, nukuluwiti gwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">gwenga gumpikaniriti panukuluwiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">Paweriti mumtima gwa kuhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">nukuliliiriti guntangi, gwenga gupikaniriti kulila kwaneni.<verse eid="JON 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />Gwenga gunasiriti neni pasi nentu mubahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:3">mashi gavuwa gangubikiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:3">mankapala pamuhera na mashi gavuwa gapititi pampindi paneni.<verse eid="JON 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />Nuliholiti kuwera ntuluwa gweka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:4">nawera kulongolu kwaku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:4">nawona kayi Numba nkulu yaku nanagala.<verse eid="JON 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />Mashi ganzyengekiti na kumbabanika wega zyoseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:5">bahali ingubikiti nakamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:5">mahamba ga mubahali gangubikiti pamtuwi.<verse eid="JON 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />Nseleriti mpaka payanjira migongu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:6">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">muisi ya wantu yawahowiti</char>
    </note>muisi magomi gakuwi gatatuwa mashaka goseri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:6">Kumbiti gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:6">gunkweneziya namkomu kulawa mulirindi amu.<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />Paweriti nankuhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:7">nukuholiti gwee Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:7">maluwa gangu gasokiti kwaku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:7">Mnumba nkulu yaku nanagala.<verse eid="JON 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />Wantu woseri yawaviguwira vinyagu vya milungu ya upayira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:8">wasira kutali uaminika wawu kwaku.<verse eid="JON 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />Kumbiti hanukwimbiri gwenga lwimbu kulonga mayagashii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:9">hanukulaviliri tambiku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:9">Hantendi shilii shandagiliti kutenda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:9">Mtuwa Mlungu, gwenga ndo ulii yaguweza kutulopoziya.”<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamlagalira somba ulii kamtapiki Yona muisi iyuma.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s">Yona kankugenda Ninawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti kayi Yona, <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />“Gugendi lushi lukulu lwa Ninawi, guwagambiri wantu ujumbi yanukupananiti pamberi.”<verse eid="JON 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Shaka ashi, Yona kamjimiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, su yomberi kagenditi Ninawi. Ninawi luweriti lushi lukulu nentu, muntu mekawezi kugenda kwa mashaka matatu su mekalumalili kutyanga kila wega. <verse eid="JON 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" />Yona pakwingira kala mlushi, katyangiti mwanja gwa lishaka limu. Yomberi kaweriti kankuwabwerera wantu pakalonga, “Pamashaka malongu msheshi, Ninawi hayiyagamiziwi!”<verse eid="JON 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" />Su wantu wa Ninawi waujimiriti ujumbi wa Mlungu. Womberi woseri wamuwiti kuwera kila muntu kafiruwiti koya kuliya shiboga. Wantu woseri walunda na wahushu, woyiti kuliya shiboga. Woseri wavaliti malobota kulanguziya waleka vidoda vyawatenditi.<verse eid="JON 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />Mfalumi gwa Ninawi pakapikaniriti shilii wantu wa Ninawi wankutenda, yomberi kavuliti nguwu zakuwi zya shifalumi, su kavaliti malobota. Kalekiti kulikala pahala pakuwi pa shifalumi na kalikaliti pasi papaweriti na livu. <verse eid="JON 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" />Shakapanu mfalumi ulii kabweriti ujumbi kwa wantu wa Ninawi, “Neni mfalumi pamuhera na wakulu yawangu tulonga kuwera, muntu yoseri nakaliya shiboga ama kulanda shoseri. Namuwalekeziya wang'ombi ama wankanyama wakuloleruwa waliyi ama kulanda shintu shoseri. <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" />Wantu woseri pamuhera na wankanyama wavali malobota. Kila muntu kamluwi nakaka Mlungu. Na kila muntu koyi kutenda vidoda pamuhera na kutenda ungondu kwa muyaguwi. <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" />Gaa yakavimana? Pamonga Mlungu mekagalambuli nfiru yakuwi, hakaleki maya gakuwi kwatenga, su natwiza kwagamira!”<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Su Mlungu pakawoniti nakaka kuwera waleka vidoda vyawatenditi, kawawoneriti lusungu na kalekiti maholu ga kuwagamiziya.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s">Yona kakalala toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawera na lusungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Kumbiti shitwatira ashi shimtenditi Yona kakalali nentu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kagamiziyiti ndiri Ninawi. <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" />Su kamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu pakalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gutenda shilii shanushiholiti kuwera megushitendi, pamberi neni hanelawi ukaya. Ntambu ayi intenditi neni ntugili muisi ya Tarishishi, toziya nuvimaniti kuwera gwenga gwee Mlungu gwana ufiru na lusungu kwa wantu woseri. Gwenga gwahera maya ga kanongola kwa wantu yawatenda ukondola. Gwenga guwafira nentu wantu na guwera na lusungu, gugalambula maholu gaku ga kuwazibu wantu yawateda vidoda. <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" />Su vinu gundagi, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, iherepa neni kuhowa kuliku kulikala.”<verse eid="JON 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankuliti, “Hashi, iherepa gwenga kukalala?”<verse eid="JON 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Yona kalawiti kunja kwa lushi lwa Ninawi na kalikaliti uwega kwagulawa mshenji. Kulii kalinyawiriti mweni shisasa na kalivagiti mushivinyiwu shakuwi, kaheperiti kuwona shilii shashigenda kulawila mlushi. <verse eid="JON 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kagumeriziyiti mzyabibu gukuli pakwegera na Yona na gumpanani shivinyilu kumpungulira ntabiku yakaweriti nayu. Yona kanemeleriti nentu kuwera na mzyabibu agu. <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Kumbiti lishaka lya pili paushiyiti, Mlungu kamtenditi mengali kaguliyi mzyabibu gulii, mzyabibu gulii gunyaliti. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" />Shakapanu mshenji pagulawiti, Mlungu kajegiti lipuga lyaliwera na lifuki kulawa kwagulawa mshenji, mshenji gumulawaliti Yona mumtuwi gwakuwi su kaweriti legilegi. Yomberi kafiriti kuhowa, su kalongiti, “Iherepa kwa neni kuhowa kuliku kwendereya kulikala!” <verse eid="JON 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamkosiyiti Yona, “Hashi, iherepa gwenga kulala kwa shashilawiriti mushimeru?” Yona kawankuliti, “Yina iherepa! Neni nkalala nfira kuhowa!” <verse eid="JON 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti, “Gwenga gushiwonera lusungu shimeru ashi yagushiyaliti ndiri ama kugutenda gukuli. Gweni gukuliti pashiru pamu na gunyaliti pashiru papafatiti. <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" />Hashi, ifaa ndiri neni kuluwonera lusungu Ninawi, lushi lulii lukulu lwaluwera na wana wavuwa nentu ya miya yimu na malongu mawili elufu, yawamana ndiri maheri ama madoda, viraa wankanyama wavuwa?”<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>